@title Crazy Taxi - Catch a Ride (USA)
@file Crazy Taxi - Catch a Ride (U).gba
@game A3CE
@chip EEPROM (EEPROM_V122; a 4 Kbit chip, dingbat and mgba write 512 bytes)
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba

# Logos, title, CRAZY TAXI > NORMAL RULES (the first A there is not taken)
# > CITY 1 > AXEL, A held to drive into the wall, released: the taxi rolls
# into a customer (fare $1,491.00), START pauses and resumes, and the clock
# runs out with the fare undelivered. RESULT ($0.00, 99TH), SELECT YOUR
# NAME > REGISTER A NEW NAME > "AAA", back at MODE SELECTION, SAVE & LOAD
# > SAVE > YES. [load]: RECORDS lists "AAA RECORDS", opened.
# Findings (recorded 2026-10-16):
# - mgba stands alone in the race (driving DIFFERENT, paused MAJOR): in the
#   live session its loading screen ran behind (clock icon, READY/SET/GO),
#   and its taxi meets the wall and the customer on other frames; dingbat
#   and the second reference share every checkpoint frame there.
# - select_name: dingbat alone, by one red step on the translucent
#   "A-CONFIRM" bar (rows 145-158, (27,26,12) against (28,26,12)): §72's
#   blend rounding; dingbat truncates as the SP's blendprobe photographs
#   do, mGBA blends colours widened to 8 bits and the second reference
#   rounds.
# - Audio: one window (f15690, the menu sound as SAVE & LOAD is chosen)
#   has another spectrum on dingbat than on both references; mgba and the
#   second reference differ from each other in 193 of 1110 windows.
# - The second reference writes an 8 KB file (A3CE is not in emu.py's
#   EEPROM_4K) and its [load] shows "--- RECORDS": it loses its own save.
[new]
wait 870
wait 60
wait 810
checkpoint title window=30
wait 300
press START
wait 180
checkpoint mode_select window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 120
wait 60
press A
wait 120
press A
wait 180
wait 60
press A
wait 150
wait 60
press A
wait 300
checkpoint loading window=30
wait 540
wait 60
wait 120
hold A
wait 300
checkpoint driving window=30
hold A+LEFT
wait 60
hold A
wait 300
wait 60
release
wait 2400
press START
wait 60
checkpoint paused window=30 compare=text
press START
wait 6900
wait 300
checkpoint result window=30
press A
wait 150
press START
wait 150
press A
wait 450
checkpoint select_name window=30
press A
wait 120
wait 60
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 120
wait 60
tap DOWN times=4 every=20 hold=4
wait 20
press A
wait 120
wait 60
press A
wait 90
wait 60
press A
wait 120
checkpoint saved window=30

[load]
wait 1980
press START
wait 180
checkpoint mode_select window=30 compare=text
tap DOWN times=3 every=20 hold=4
wait 20
press A
wait 120
checkpoint records window=30 compare=text
press DOWN
wait 20
press A
wait 120
checkpoint aaa_records window=30

